<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER THIRD ROUND OF KAPALUA INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING SCORES AFTER THIRD ROUND OF KAPALUA INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>KAPALUA, Hawaii 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scores after the</p>
<p>third round of the $1.2 million Kapalua International</p>
<p>tournament on Saturday (two courses used, leaders listed in</p>
<p>relation to par, U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p> 1. Paul Stankowski	  16 under par</p>
<p> 2. Steve Jones	     -15</p>
<p> 2. Bob Gilder		-15</p>
<p> 4. Fred Couples	    -14</p>
<p> 5. Sandy Lyle (Britain)  -13</p>
<p> 5. Peter Jacobsen	  -13</p>
<p> 5. Billy Mayfair	   -13</p>
<p> 8. Scott McCarron	  -12</p>
<p> 8. Davis Love III	  -12</p>
<p>10. Glen Day		  -11</p>
<p>Other international players:</p>
<p> Grant Waite (New Zealand) -2</p>
<p> David Feherty (Britain)    Even</p>
<p> Barry Lane (Britain)     +15</p>
